#: ../plugin_dev/metadata.rst:3
msgid "Metadata"
msgstr "元数据"

#: ../plugin_dev/metadata.rst:6
msgid "Declaration"
msgstr "声明元数据"

#: ../plugin_dev/metadata.rst:8
msgid ""
"As a single ``.py`` file only plugin, the metadata of "
":ref:`plugin_dev/plugin_format:Solo Plugin` is declared in the global "
"scope of the source file. It's a dict contains several key-value with the"
" name ``PLUGIN_METADATA``"
msgstr ""
"作为一个仅有单一 ``.py`` 文件组成的插件，:ref:`plugin_dev/plugin_format:Solo Plugin` "
"的元数据声明于其源文件的全局作用域中。它是一个包含着多个键值对的，名为 ``PLUGIN_METADATA`` 的 dict 对象"

#: ../plugin_dev/metadata.rst:10
msgid "Here's a metadata example"
msgstr "下面是一个元数据例子："

#: ../plugin_dev/metadata.rst:29
msgid ""
"The following section `Fields <#fields>`__ will use metadata declared in "
"python syntax as examples"
msgstr "下面的 `属性 <#fields>`__ 小节将会使用 python 语法进行元数据声明举例"

#: ../plugin_dev/metadata.rst:33
msgid ""
"For multi file plugin, the metadata is declared in file "
"``mcdreforged.plugin.json`` in json syntax"
msgstr "对于多文件插件或者文件夹插件而言，元数据以 json 语法在文件 ``mcdreforged.plugin.json`` 中声明"

#: ../plugin_dev/metadata.rst:35
msgid "Here's an example"
msgstr "下面是一个例子："

#: ../plugin_dev/metadata.rst:57
msgid ""
"If a solo plugin doesn't declare the metadata field, a warning will arise"
" in the console and the fallback values will be used"
msgstr "如果单文件插件未声明元数据字段，则控制台中将出现警告，并使用备用值"

#: ../plugin_dev/metadata.rst:59
msgid ""
"For multi file plugins, the metadata file and its ``id`` and ``version`` "
"fields are required"
msgstr "对于多文件插件，元数据文件必须存在，其 ``id``、``version`` 字段也都是必须的"

#: ../plugin_dev/metadata.rst:63
msgid ""
"For python package requirements, it's suggested to declare them in a file"
" named ``requirements.txt``, then :doc:`pack </cli/pack>` it into your "
"packed plugin"
msgstr ""
"对于 Python 包依赖，建议将它们声明在名为 ``requirements.txt`` 的文件中，然后把它 :doc:`打包进 "
"</cli/pack>` 你的打包插件中"

#: ../plugin_dev/metadata.rst:66
msgid "Fields"
msgstr "属性"

#: ../plugin_dev/metadata.rst:69
msgid "schema_version"
msgstr "schema_version"

#: ../plugin_dev/metadata.rst:71
msgid ""
"The format version of ``mcdreforged.plugin.json``. Use ``1`` for the "
"format introduced in v2.16.0. Omitting this field means version ``0`` and"
" remains supported. If the version is newer than MCDR supports, MCDR will"
" warn and attempt to read the known fields"
msgstr ""
"``mcdreforged.plugin.json`` 的格式版本。对于 v2.16.0 中引入的格式，请使用 ``1``。省略此字段表示版本为 "
"``0``，该版本仍受支持。如果版本比 MCDR 所支持的更新，MCDR 将会发出警告，并尝试读取其中已知的字段"

#: ../plugin_dev/metadata.rst:75
msgid ""
"This does not replace the plugin's ``version`` or its ``mcdreforged`` "
"dependency requirement"
msgstr "此字段不能替代插件的 ``version``，也不能替代其对 ``mcdreforged`` 的依赖要求"

#: ../plugin_dev/metadata.rst:79
msgid "Only used in ``mcdreforged.plugin.json``, not in solo plugin metadata"
msgstr "仅用于 ``mcdreforged.plugin.json``，不适用于单文件插件的元数据"

#: ../plugin_dev/metadata.rst:83
msgid "Field key: ``schema_version``"
msgstr "字段键名：``schema_version``"

#: ../plugin_dev/metadata.rst:84
msgid "Value type: int"
msgstr "字段类型：int"

#: ../plugin_dev/metadata.rst:85
msgid "Fallback value: ``0``"
msgstr "备用值：``0``"

#: ../plugin_dev/metadata.rst:88
msgid "id"
msgstr "id"

#: ../plugin_dev/metadata.rst:90
msgid ""
"ID, or plugin id, is the identity string of your plugin. It should start "
"with a lowercase letter and consist of lowercase letters, numbers and "
"underscores with a length of 1 to 64"
msgstr "ID（即插件 ID）是你插件的“身份证号”。它应以小写字母为前缀，由小写字母，数字和下划线组成，长度为 1 到 64"

#: ../plugin_dev/metadata.rst:92
msgid "Here's some available plugin ids:"
msgstr "以下是一些可用的插件 ID："

#: ../plugin_dev/metadata.rst:95
msgid "``my_plugin``"
msgstr "``my_plugin``"

#: ../plugin_dev/metadata.rst:96
msgid "``anotherhelper123``"
msgstr "``anotherhelper123``"

#: ../plugin_dev/metadata.rst:97
msgid "``a_cool_plugin``"
msgstr "``a_cool_plugin``"

#: ../plugin_dev/metadata.rst:99
msgid "But the following ids are not allowed:"
msgstr "但不允许使用以下ID："

#: ../plugin_dev/metadata.rst:102
msgid "``MyPlugin``"
msgstr "``MyPlugin``"

#: ../plugin_dev/metadata.rst:103
msgid "``another-helper-123``"
msgstr "``another-helper-123``"

#: ../plugin_dev/metadata.rst:104
msgid "``a cool plugin``"
msgstr "``a cool plugin``"

#: ../plugin_dev/metadata.rst:106
msgid ""
"MCDR uses plugin id to distinguish between different plugins and check "
"the dependencies. All loaded plugin in MCDR contain different plugin ids."
" If a newly loaded plugin has a plugin id exactly the same with an "
"existed plugin, the new plugin will fail to load"
msgstr ""
"MCDR 使用插件 ID 来区分不同的插件并检查插件间的依赖。MCDR 中加载的所有插件都应使用不同的插件 "
"ID。如果新加载的插件具有与现有插件完全相同的插件 ID，则新插件将无法加载"

#: ../plugin_dev/metadata.rst:108
msgid ""
"Choose your plugin id wisely. It's highly suggested to keep your plugin "
"id not changed after release your plugin"
msgstr "请明智地选择你的插件 ID。强烈建议你在发布插件后不要再更改插件 ID"

#: ../plugin_dev/metadata.rst:112
msgid ""
"Be careful about potential package name conflict. It is not recommended "
"to take an id that is the same as the standard library / third-party "
"library name for your plugin, e.g. ``test``, otherwise MCDR might not "
"able to load your plugin correctly"
msgstr ""
"小心可能的包名冲突。非常不推荐为你的插件取一个与标准库 / 第三方库名相同的 id，如 ``test``，否则 MCDR "
"很可能无法正确地加载你的插件"

#: ../plugin_dev/metadata.rst:116
msgid "Field key: ``id``"
msgstr "字段键名：``id``"

#: ../plugin_dev/metadata.rst:117 ../plugin_dev/metadata.rst:138
#: ../plugin_dev/metadata.rst:150 ../plugin_dev/metadata.rst:238
#: ../plugin_dev/metadata.rst:273 ../plugin_dev/metadata.rst:404
#: ../plugin_dev/metadata.rst:421
msgid "Value type: str"
msgstr "字段类型：str"

#: ../plugin_dev/metadata.rst:118
msgid ""
"Fallback value: the file name without the ``.py`` extension if it's a "
"solo plugin"
msgstr "备用值：不含 ``.py`` 后缀的插件文件名，如果你的插件是一个单文件插件"

#: ../plugin_dev/metadata.rst:121
msgid "version"
msgstr "version"

#: ../plugin_dev/metadata.rst:123
msgid ""
"The version value indicates the version of your plugin. It's mostly in "
"`semver <https://semver.org/>`__ format but it has less restriction such "
"as you can have the core version with any length"
msgstr ""
"version 字段代表你的插件版本。它基本上采用了 `语义化版本 <https://semver.org/lang/zh-CN/>`__ "
"的格式，不过限制较少，如你可以定义任意长度的版本号"

#: ../plugin_dev/metadata.rst:125
msgid "Here's some available version:"
msgstr "以下一些可用的版本："

#: ../plugin_dev/metadata.rst:128
msgid "``1.0.0``"
msgstr "``1.0.0``"

#: ../plugin_dev/metadata.rst:129
msgid "``2.0``"
msgstr "``2.0``"

#: ../plugin_dev/metadata.rst:130
msgid "``1.2.3-pre4``"
msgstr "``1.2.3-pre4``"

#: ../plugin_dev/metadata.rst:131
msgid "``1.8.9-rc.8``"
msgstr "``1.8.9-rc.8``"

#: ../plugin_dev/metadata.rst:132
msgid "``1.14.1-beta.4+build.54``"
msgstr "``1.14.1-beta.4+build.54``"

#: ../plugin_dev/metadata.rst:134
msgid ""
"Following `semver <https://semver.org/>`__ format for you version string "
"is a good idea. It's easier to maintain and for people to understand"
msgstr ""
"遵循 `语义化版本 <https://semver.org/lang/zh-CN/>`__ "
"格式为你的插件定义版本字符串是一个好主意——易于维护、易于理解"

#: ../plugin_dev/metadata.rst:137
msgid "Field key: ``version``"
msgstr "字段键名：``version``"

#: ../plugin_dev/metadata.rst:139
msgid ""
"Fallback value: ``0.0.0`` for solo plugins; required for multi file "
"plugins"
msgstr "备用值：单文件插件为 ``0.0.0``；多文件插件则必须声明"

#: ../plugin_dev/metadata.rst:142
msgid "name"
msgstr "name"

#: ../plugin_dev/metadata.rst:144
msgid ""
"The name of your plugin. Give your plugin with a nice name with any kinds"
" of characters"
msgstr "你的插件名称——给你的插件起一个好听的名字吧"

#: ../plugin_dev/metadata.rst:146
msgid ""
"Try not to make the name too long. For more details of your plugin, you "
"can put them into the ``description``"
msgstr "尽量不要使插件名称太长。你可以把插件的详细信息放在 ``description`` 之中"

#: ../plugin_dev/metadata.rst:149
msgid "Field key: ``name``"
msgstr "字段键名：``name``"

#: ../plugin_dev/metadata.rst:151 ../plugin_dev/metadata.rst:405
msgid "Fallback value: The plugin id"
msgstr "备用值：插件 ID"

#: ../plugin_dev/metadata.rst:154
msgid "description"
msgstr "description"

#: ../plugin_dev/metadata.rst:156
msgid ""
"The description of you plugin. Go write down the functionality summarize "
"of your plugin here"
msgstr "你的插件描述。在这里写下你的插件的功能总结吧"

#: ../plugin_dev/metadata.rst:158 ../plugin_dev/metadata.rst:183
#: ../plugin_dev/metadata.rst:234
msgid "This field is optional, you can just ignore it if you are lazy"
msgstr "此字段是可选的。如果你想偷懒的话可以不填写"

#: ../plugin_dev/metadata.rst:160
msgid ""
"For translation purpose, instead of using a ``str`` as the value, you can"
" use a Dict[str, str] indicating a mapping from language to description "
"as value, e.g.:"
msgstr "处于翻译的目的，除了使用一个 ``str`` 作为值外，你还可以使用一个代表着从语言映射到描述文本的 Dict[str, str] 映射作为值，如："

#: ../plugin_dev/metadata.rst:170
msgid "Field key: ``description``"
msgstr "字段键名：``description``"

#: ../plugin_dev/metadata.rst:171
msgid "Value type: Union[str, Dict[str, str]]"
msgstr "字段类型：Union[str, Dict[str, str]]"

#: ../plugin_dev/metadata.rst:172 ../plugin_dev/metadata.rst:188
#: ../plugin_dev/metadata.rst:212 ../plugin_dev/metadata.rst:223
#: ../plugin_dev/metadata.rst:239 ../plugin_dev/metadata.rst:263
#: ../plugin_dev/metadata.rst:274 ../plugin_dev/metadata.rst:365
#: ../plugin_dev/metadata.rst:422 ../plugin_dev/metadata.rst:439
msgid "Fallback value: None"
msgstr "备用值：None"

#: ../plugin_dev/metadata.rst:175
msgid "author"
msgstr "author"

#: ../plugin_dev/metadata.rst:177
msgid ""
"Use :ref:`plugin_dev/metadata:authors` instead. This field remains "
"supported. When both fields are provided, names from ``author`` are "
"appended to ``authors`` without deduplication"
msgstr ""
"请使用 :ref:`plugin_dev/metadata:authors` "
"作为替代。此字段仍然受支持。当同时提供这两个字段时，``author`` 中的名字会被追加到 ``authors`` 中，且不会去重"

#: ../plugin_dev/metadata.rst:181
msgid ""
"The authors of the plugins. If there's only a single author, you can also"
" use a string instead of a list of string"
msgstr "插件作者。如果只有一个作者，可使用 string 而非 list"

#: ../plugin_dev/metadata.rst:186
msgid "Field key: ``author``"
msgstr "字段键名：``author``"

#: ../plugin_dev/metadata.rst:187
msgid "Value type: str or List[str]"
msgstr "字段类型：str 或 list[str]"

#: ../plugin_dev/metadata.rst:191
msgid "authors"
msgstr "authors"

#: ../plugin_dev/metadata.rst:193
msgid ""
"The original authors and main creators of the plugin. Each person can be "
"a string containing their name, or a dict with a required ``name`` and "
"optional ``email`` and ``homepage`` string fields. You can provide a "
"single person or a list of people, mixing strings and dicts"
msgstr ""
"插件的原作者和主要创作者。每个人可以是一个包含其名字的字符串，也可以是一个 dict——其中 ``name`` 为必需字段，``email`` 和"
" ``homepage`` 为可选的字符串字段。你可以只提供一个人，也可以提供一个由人组成的列表，并在其中混合使用字符串和 dict"

#: ../plugin_dev/metadata.rst:210
msgid "Field key: ``authors``"
msgstr "字段键名：``authors``"

#: ../plugin_dev/metadata.rst:211 ../plugin_dev/metadata.rst:222
msgid "Value type: str or Dict[str, str] or List[Union[str, Dict[str, str]]]"
msgstr "字段类型：str 或 Dict[str, str] 或 List[Union[str, Dict[str, str]]]"

#: ../plugin_dev/metadata.rst:215
msgid "maintainers"
msgstr "maintainers"

#: ../plugin_dev/metadata.rst:217
msgid ""
"The people currently maintaining the plugin. This field uses the same "
"format as :ref:`plugin_dev/metadata:authors`"
msgstr "当前维护该插件的人。此字段的格式与 :ref:`plugin_dev/metadata:authors` 相同"

#: ../plugin_dev/metadata.rst:221
msgid "Field key: ``maintainers``"
msgstr "字段键名：``maintainers``"

#: ../plugin_dev/metadata.rst:226
msgid "link"
msgstr "link"

#: ../plugin_dev/metadata.rst:228
msgid ""
"Use :ref:`plugin_dev/metadata:links` instead. This field remains "
"supported. Its value is used as ``links.homepage`` when that value is "
"missing or None"
msgstr ""
"请使用 :ref:`plugin_dev/metadata:links` 作为替代。此字段仍然受支持。当 ``links.homepage`` "
"缺失或为 None 时，本字段的值将作为 ``links.homepage`` 使用"

#: ../plugin_dev/metadata.rst:232
msgid ""
"The url to your plugin. You can put a link to the github repository of "
"your plugin here. It should be an available url"
msgstr "你的插件的网址。你可以将其指向插件的 github 链接。它的值应为一个可访问的网址"

#: ../plugin_dev/metadata.rst:237
msgid "Field key: ``link``"
msgstr "字段键名：``link``"

#: ../plugin_dev/metadata.rst:242
msgid "links"
msgstr "links"

#: ../plugin_dev/metadata.rst:244
msgid "Links related to the plugin. All of the following keys are optional:"
msgstr "与插件相关的链接。以下所有键都是可选的："

#: ../plugin_dev/metadata.rst:246
msgid "``homepage``: The plugin homepage"
msgstr "``homepage``：插件主页"

#: ../plugin_dev/metadata.rst:247
msgid "``source``: The source code repository"
msgstr "``source``：源代码仓库"

#: ../plugin_dev/metadata.rst:248
msgid "``documentation``: The documentation page"
msgstr "``documentation``：文档页面"

#: ../plugin_dev/metadata.rst:249
msgid "``issues``: The issue tracker"
msgstr "``issues``：问题追踪页面"

#: ../plugin_dev/metadata.rst:261
msgid "Field key: ``links``"
msgstr "字段键名：``links``"

#: ../plugin_dev/metadata.rst:262
msgid "Value type: Dict[str, Optional[str]]"
msgstr "字段类型：Dict[str, Optional[str]]"

#: ../plugin_dev/metadata.rst:266
msgid "license"
msgstr "license"

#: ../plugin_dev/metadata.rst:268
msgid ""
"The license of the plugin. An `SPDX license identifier "
"<https://spdx.org/licenses/>`__, such as ``LGPL-3.0``, is "
"recommended"
msgstr ""
"插件的许可证。推荐使用 `SPDX 许可证标识符 <https://spdx.org/licenses/>`__，例如 "
"``LGPL-3.0``"

#: ../plugin_dev/metadata.rst:272
msgid "Field key: ``license``"
msgstr "字段键名：``license``"

#: ../plugin_dev/metadata.rst:277
msgid "dependencies"
msgstr "dependencies"

#: ../plugin_dev/metadata.rst:279
msgid ""
"A dict of dependencies you plugin relies on. It's a dict contains several"
" key-value pairs. The key is the id of the plugin that your plugin is "
"relies on, and the value is the version requirement of the plugin that "
"your plugin is relies on"
msgstr "插件的依赖关系。应为一个字典，其中包含多个键值对。键为插件所依赖的插件 ID，值是插件所依赖插件的版本要求"

#: ../plugin_dev/metadata.rst:281
msgid ""
"If your plugin has requirement to the version of MCDR, use "
"``mcdreforged`` as the plugin id"
msgstr "如果你的插件对 MCDR 版本有需求，请使用 mcdreforged 作为插件 ID"

#: ../plugin_dev/metadata.rst:283
msgid ""
"A version requirement is a string than contains several criterions of the"
" version. Criterions are divided by space character, each criterion is "
"made up of an operator and a base version string. Wildcard is allowed "
"when describing the base version"
msgstr "版本要求是一个包含若干个版本约束的字符串。约束按空格划分，每个每个由一个运算符和一个基础版本字符串组成。描述基版本时允许使用通配符"

#: ../plugin_dev/metadata.rst:285
msgid "List of the operators:"
msgstr "运算符列表："

#: ../plugin_dev/metadata.rst:290
