#: ../plugin_dev/metadata.rst:368
msgid "requirements_file"
msgstr "requirements_file"

#: ../plugin_dev/metadata.rst:370
msgid ""
"The Python requirements file inside a multi file plugin. This field "
"controls which file is used for dependency checks, packing and Python "
"dependency installation:"
msgstr "多文件插件内部的 Python 依赖文件。此字段决定了哪个文件会被用于依赖检查、打包和 Python 依赖安装："

#: ../plugin_dev/metadata.rst:373
msgid "If omitted, MCDR uses ``requirements.txt`` when it exists"
msgstr "如果省略，则当 ``requirements.txt`` 存在时，MCDR 会使用它"

#: ../plugin_dev/metadata.rst:374
msgid ""
"If set to ``null`` in JSON (``None`` in Python), no requirements file is "
"used"
msgstr "如果在 JSON 中设为 ``null``（在 Python 中为 ``None``），则不使用任何依赖文件"

#: ../plugin_dev/metadata.rst:375
msgid ""
"If set to a string, that file must exist, even when the value is "
"``\"requirements.txt\"``"
msgstr "如果设为一个字符串，则该文件必须存在，即使其值为 ``\"requirements.txt\"``"

#: ../plugin_dev/metadata.rst:377
msgid ""
"The path is relative to the plugin root and must stay inside it. Absolute"
" paths and ``..`` path components are not allowed. For example, "
"``\"requirements_file\": \"deps/runtime.txt\"`` selects a file in the "
"plugin's ``deps`` directory"
msgstr ""
"该路径相对于插件根目录，且必须位于插件根目录之内。不允许使用绝对路径，也不允许包含 ``..`` "
"路径片段。例如，``\"requirements_file\": \"deps/runtime.txt\"`` 会选中插件 ``deps`` "
"目录中的一个文件"

